{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["And the reason for <b>וְאָהֵבְךָ</b> ('and He will love you'): when you perform the ordinances for the love of HaShem, He too will love you. And it is possible that <b>וְאָהֵבְךָ</b> is a hifil form — that He endears you to the families being judged, and they will not hate you on account of them. <b>וּבֵרַכְךָ</b> ('and He will bless you') — that no harm befall you on account of the judgment. <b>וְהִרְבֶּךָ</b> ('and He will multiply you') — that you not decrease through the loss of those who are executed, even if many are lost, such as the people of a seduced city."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T02:46:32.540398274Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}